  "configuration_id": "config_014",
  "reason": "Evidence: The best result (config_024, 0.7250) uses scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted + multiprofile. All major design choices (RNA encoder, image encoder, aggregation, fusion, profile) have been explored, and no untested configuration combines all four 'best' settings simultaneously. The only untested variant in the top-performing neighborhood that retains three of the four strongest choices (scvi_n200, transformer, weighted) while varying the image encoder is config_014 (scvi_n200, resnet50, transformer, weighted). This tests whether the transformer aggregation provides a similar boost with resnet50 as it did with imagenet_vit_l (config_018→config_024 gave +0.019), or whether the image encoder quality is the dominant factor. Since this is the final experiment and our best (0.7250) is unlikely to be surpassed by any remaining option, this is the most informative exploitation test in the high-accuracy region. Expected cost: moderate (~4–5 GPU hours, comparable to other transformer+resnet50 multiprofile runs), keeping total budget around ~49 GPU hours."
}

